# AF-Owned Files
#
# Files and directories in .github/ that are owned by the Agent Framework.
# Non-AF files (workflows, CODEOWNERS, dependabot.yml, etc.) are NOT owned
# by AF and will never be overwritten by AF installation or updates.
#
# This manifest enables safe updates: only listed paths are touched.
#
# Annotation syntax: path  [annotation1, annotation2]
#   [customizable] — project may modify; protected on update
#   [optional]     — may not exist in AF source; no warning if missing
#   [vscode]       — deployed to .vscode/ instead of .github/

# Agents
agents/

# Project configuration
af-env.conf                                              [customizable]

# Hooks
hooks/
hooks/scripts/_common.ps1
hooks/scripts/_common.sh
hooks/scripts/researcher-pretooluse.ps1
hooks/scripts/researcher-pretooluse.sh
hooks/scripts/planner-pretooluse.ps1
hooks/scripts/planner-pretooluse.sh
hooks/scripts/coordinator-postmerge.ps1
